Z||000007||84Bill||05-02-2001||11:17 PM||||HA!! LOL<P>I love it!<BR>Hey Nyte check this out ta give you some ideas<BR> <A HREF="http://cn308598-a.wall1.pa.home.com/" TARGET=_blank>http://cn308598-a.wall1.pa.home.com/</A> <P>And <P> <A HREF="http://members.home.net/toniwryan/engine.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://members.home.net/toniwryan/engine.htm</A> <P>just picture <A HREF="http://members.home.net/toniwryan/images/25mov0.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://members.home.net/toniwryan/images/25mov0.jpg</A> <P>Love a good healthy diet of Oil and as much attention as you can possibly muster. They love to have their own room to sleep in and long twisting roads to play on. Your end result should be a happy 3000 pound Fiero<BR>||||reg||10
